    {
      "id": "l6b3cwr9",
      "name": "Clarenze",
      "expanded": false,
      "text": "Clarenze\n\nIn the basement of the Seidyne building.\nIf the player gives him the R3dF0x1 password, he can get into your father's hack.\n\n#todo\nWhat does the hack do?",
      "children": [
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ovriq3on",
      "name": "Itera",
      "expanded": false,
      "text": "Itera\n\nThe player meets her in the _Harbor Streets_.\nIF the player goes with her, she gives them their first mission in Shellspace.\n\nFind Clarenze",
      "children": [
      ]
    },
