        {
          "id": "cpvyfnp2",
          "name": "Bedroom",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Bedroom\n\nPlot:\n\n* Enter Shellspace.\n* Learn about the _House Alarm_.\n* Encounter the name Perihelion (_Who is Perihelion?_)\n* Encounter the phrase \"Go Deeper\".\n* USB to get to Shellspace.\n* Discover the password: R3dF0x1.\n    * Give this to Clarenze in Shellspace.\n* You get a call from your dad, alarm code is:\n    2355",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "n0wiyivi",
          "name": "Hall",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Hall\n\nThe alarm puzzle is here.\nThe code to enter is given to the player via a phone call in the _Bedroom_.\n\n",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "0d7m2sqf",
          "name": "Office",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Office\n\nPlot:\n\nFind paper that says:\n\n\"Encountered Retrograde\"\n\n",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ro3x0p7a",
          "name": "Garage",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Garage\n\nPlot:\n\n* Find paper with 'aphelion' on it. This is the code for the hidden room in the Master Bedroom closet.",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s56w1nab",
          "name": "Kitchen",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Kitchen\n\nPlot:\n\n* The items in the pantry are empty.\n* The fridge is completely empty.\n* Long clump of hair in the sink.\n    #todo : How will this tie into the game?",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2krv0jt5",
          "name": "Master Bedroom",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Master Bedroom\n\n",
