        {
          "id": "r0x909nq",
          "name": "Harbor Streets",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Harbor Streets\n\nIn this location the player meets _Itera_ however - if they don't fully\ninteract with her - that is a big deal!\n\nIf they don't do 'x girl', then follow her south, and 'x girl' again,\nthey don't learn about Clarenze, and don't get the mission to find him.\n\nSo they won't know how to use the R3dF0x1 password.",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
